{"type":"FeatureCollection","municipality_code":"36302","pref":"徳島県","city":"上勝町","display_comment":"上勝町には、地域の歴史や暮らしを伝える案内板や石碑があり、それらを手がかりに街歩きを楽しめます。 まずは社寺・石碑・案内板に目を向けると、地域の由緒をたどる手がかりが見つけやすいでしょう。 現地では石碑、地蔵、地域資料館、公民館の由緒板を既存ピンと照らし合わせながら歩くと、見落としがちな地域の物語に出会いやすくなります。 「月ヶ谷温泉」や「樫原の棚田（重要文化的景観・日本の棚田百選）」などの名所も、地域の物語を深掘りする絶好の入口です。 さらに、「つまもの 彩（いろどり）」や「阿波晩茶…上勝阿波晩茶（山田産業有限会社）」といった名物や食文化に触れると、その土地らしい暮らしまで感じられるでしょう。","layer_counts":{"public_facilities":12,"scenic_nature_areas":2,"cultural_facilities":1,"tourism_resources":6},"total_features":21,"features":[{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"public_facilities","name":"高鉾公民館","category":"public","address":"上勝町大字正木字中津66","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"36302","municipality_pref":"徳島県","municipality_name":"上勝町","municipality_code_method":"source_exact_coord"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[134.428025,33.920764]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"public_facilities","name":"基幹集落センター","category":"public","address":"上勝町大字旭字蔭66","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"36302","municipality_pref":"徳島県","municipality_name":"上勝町","municipality_code_method":"source_exact_coord"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[134.389763598855,33.8785630252053]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"public_facilities","name":"上勝町役場","category":"public","address":"上勝町大字福原字下横峯3-1","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"36302","municipality_pref":"徳島県","municipality_name":"上勝町","municipality_code_method":"source_exact_coord"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[134.401833,33.888956]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"public_facilities","name":"福原多目的集会所","category":"public","address":"上勝町大字福原字平間45-2","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"36302","municipality_pref":"徳島県","municipality_name":"上勝町","municipality_code_method":"source_exact_coord"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[134.416671015574,33.8850221295766]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"public_f